WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.425
Compare the primes of the two numbers.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.975
Twelve is two times two times three.

3
00:00:12.324 --> 00:00:15.024
Eighteen is two times three times three.

4
00:00:22.683 --> 00:00:26.333
The shared primes make six: the highest common factor.

5
00:00:26.961 --> 00:00:30.836
All the primes make thirty-six: the lowest common multiple.
